    "chunk_text": "hten eow \u00e6r gemiltsode & eow gem\u00e6nifylde, swa he eow forde\u00f0 & geny\u00f0era\u00f0 & Drihten eow adrif\u00f0 geond ealle \u00f0eoda o\u00f0 eor\u00f0an endas, & ge \u00f0eowia\u00f0 \u00f0am godum \u00f0e ge ne cunnon, Witodlice ne gereste ge on nanum earde; he sent on eow forhte heortan & geteoriende eagan & & eow bi\u00f0 eower lyf \u00e6wene; ge ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 eow dea\u00f0 d\u00e6ges & nihtes. On \u00e6rnemergen ge cwe\u00f0a\u00f0: Hwa hylp\u00f0 us \u00f0\u00e6t we \u00e6fnes gebidan; & on \u00e6fen ge cwe\u00f0a\u00f0: Hwa fylst Scyphere eow nim\u00f0 & syl\u00f0 eow eowrum feondum to ceape, & eow ne alyst nan man. \u00d0IS synd \u00f0a word \u00f0e Drihten bebead Moyse \u00f0\u00e6t he bude Israhela folce on Moab lande, butan \u00f0am & Moyses clypode eall Israhela folc, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Ge gesawon ealle \u00f0a \u00f0ingc \u00f0e Drihten worhte Drihten eow ne sealde undergytende heortan, ne eagan to geseonne, ne earan to gehyrenne o\u00f0 \u00f0isne He l\u00e6dde eow feowertig wintra geond \u00f0\u00e6t westen: n\u00e6ron eowre reaf forwerode, ne eowre gescyg mid Ne \u00e6te ge hlaf, ne drunce ge win ne beor, \u00f0\u00e6t ge wiston \u00f0\u00e6t he is Drihten, eower God. & ge comon to \u00f0isse stowe, & Seon, cyng of Esebon, for ut & Og, cyng of Basan, for ongean us to & namon hyra land, & sealdon hit Rubene to \u00e6hte & Gade & healfre Mannases m",
